</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bf2d388c-7a04-11f1-affa-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-07T060004Z-787959074-RC2T8MA6XBI1-RTRMADP-3-INDONESIA-INDIA.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bf2d388c-7a04-11f1-affa-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-07T060004Z-787959074-RC2T8MA6XBI1-RTRMADP-3-INDONESIA-INDIA.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">93a39f7a-7b6d-11f1-998f-c37bb18c364f</guid><pubDate>Thu, 09 Jul 2026 10:36:30 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>曼谷特约记者 江枫</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>澳总理赞印度为“顶级安全伙伴” 双方同意深化防务关系、关键矿产合作等</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260709-%E6%BE%B3%E6%80%BB%E7%90%86%E8%B5%9E%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%BA-%E9%A1%B6%E7%BA%A7%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%B4-%E5%8F%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E6%B7%B1%E5%8C%96%E9%98%B2%E5%8A%A1%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB-%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E7%9F%BF%E4%BA%A7%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C%E7%AD%89</link><description>
